# 2026-10-27 agent-xkey-android: guava 33.4.6-jre in Gradle 9.8.1's own lib/
# (still 33.4.6-jre in the current stable, 9.8.2) and guava 33.3.1-jre shaded
# in KGP 2.4.21's kotlin-gradle-plugin jar; build-only, not in the APK. Every
# guava Gradle resolves, the APK's included, is pinned to 33.7.2 (catalog
# guavaJre, guavaAndroid). Remove with the first stable Gradle and KGP that
# ship guava 33.7.2 or later, or by 2026-11-26.
